==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Face is quite slow so it is easy to stall using meatshields. Any units that can outrange The Face such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can be of use. [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] are quite helpful as well.

